---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects the details you share when you book a tour, and how we use cookies and advertising tools.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose legal">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>This policy explains what information {site.name} collects on {site.url.replace('https://', '')} and how we use it.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you send a booking request we receive the details you type in: your name, phone or WhatsApp number, tour, date, number of guests and pickup location. If you contact us on WhatsApp or by phone, we see your number and messages.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>Only to confirm and run your tour, contact you about your booking, and answer your questions. We do not sell or rent your details to anyone.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager and Google Ads (and may use the Meta pixel) to understand how visitors use the site and to measure our advertising. These tools use cookies and similar technology. You can block cookies in your browser settings or use <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's opt-out tool</a>.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Booking details are kept for as long as needed to provide the tour and for our normal business records, then deleted.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete your details at any time by calling <a href={`tel:${site.phoneRaw}`} data-loc="privacy">{site.phone}</a>{site.email && <> or emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></>}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
